# No end-of-line conversion anywhere. Windows runners default to
# core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites vendored sources on checkout and breaks
# the checksums in vendor/*/.cargo-checksum.json (cargo --offline then refuses
# to build). It would also invalidate the hashes in SHA256SUMS.txt.
* -text
